      },
      {
        "id": "four-epoch-arm-shared-wave-with-its-two-epoch-gate",
        "resolution": "Batch-16, batch-32 and two-epoch arms form refinement wave one. The four-epoch stress arm is a separate later wave and cannot allocate until the two-epoch checkpoint, outcome lifecycle and allocation release are accepted."
      }
